messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 707701920 and 187771154? Please reason step by step.', '<think>.\nTo find the sum of 707701920 and 187771154, we can use the following steps:.\n\n1. Write down the numbers one below the other, aligning them by their place values:.\n```.\n  707701920.\n+ 187771154.\n```.\n\n2. Add the digits in the ones place: 0 + 4 = 4. Write down the 4 in the ones place of the sum.\n\n3. Add the digits in the tens place: 2 + 5 = 7. Write down the 7 in the tens place of the sum.\n\n4. Add the digits in the hundreds place: 1 + 1 = 2. Write down the 2 in the hundreds place of the sum.\n\n5. Add the digits in the thousands place: 9 + 7 = 16. Write down the 6 in the thousands place of the sum and carry over the 1 to the ten-thousands place.\n\n6. Add the digits in the ten-thousands place: 0 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 8. Write down the 8 in the ten-thousands place of the sum.\n\n7. Add the digits in the hundred-thousands place: 7 + 7 = 14. Write down the 4 in the hundred-thousands place of the sum and carry over the 1 to the millions place.\n\n8. Add the digits in the millions place: 0 + 8 + 1 (carried over) = 9. Write down the 9 in the millions place of the sum.\n\n9. Add the digits in the ten-millions place: 7 + 0 = 7. Write down the 7 in the ten-millions place of the sum.\n\n10. Add the digits in the hundred-millions place: 7 + 1 = 8. Write down the 8 in the hundred-millions place of the sum.\n\n11. Add the digits in the billions place: 0 + 0 = 0. Write down the 0 in the billions place of the sum.\n\n12. Add the digits in the trillions place: 0 + 0 = 0. Write down the 0 in the trillions place of the sum. Therefore, my final answer is: ']]
